# Sent by Cloudflare Pages with every response from the public site (DE-25).
# The site is never meant to be shown inside another site's frame, so both the
# older and the newer "do not frame me" headers are sent. The Georgia MLS search
# is a frame *inside* this site and is not affected.
# No script, style or permissions policy is set here: one that has not been
# tested against the Georgia MLS frame could break the search or its map.
# Change with a test, not by hand.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security (finding F8) tells a browser that has visited once
# to use https for this exact host for the next 180 days, even if a link says
# http. It does not name subdomains and does not ask for browser preload lists,
# so mail and other hosts under the domain are untouched. To withdraw it, send
# max-age=0 for a while before removing the line.
/*
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors 'none'
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=15552000

# The same pages are also reachable at Cloudflare's own pages.dev addresses
# (the project's and each preview's). Search engines are asked not to list
# those copies; diamondecho.com is the address to list (finding F6).
https://:project.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex

https://:version.:project.pages.dev/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex
